| `scripts/assemble_fragments.py` | Assembles references and Unreleased from independent entries; `--check` rejects stale outputs. | `make check-fragments`; `make assemble-fragments` | [`reference_fragments`](settings.md#configprojectjson) | Preserves the output's stamp. Rejects malformed, misnamed or duplicate entries and missing or unregistered folders. Every mode refuses complete entry line runs already in the newest dated section, naming the files and version. Delete those already released entries before assembling again. Not a date writer: `scripts/jobs/restamp_docs.py` stamps the assembled document. | [README.md](README.md) | always |
